3) Fix pkg-config locations.
Include /usr/local/lib/pkgconfig
cp /usr/local/lib/pkgconfig/* /usr/share/pkgconfig
rm -rf /usr/local/lib/pkgconfig
ln -s /usr/share/pkgconfig /usr/local/lib/pkgconfig


4) IAX Client:
requires portaudio
pa_stable_v190700_20210406.tgz

requires speex
/usr/lib64/libspeex.so.1.5.2

requires gsm
https://www.quut.com/gsm/gsm-1.0.22.tar.gz
locally in ./iaxclient-code/lib/gsm/

requires vidcap -- may be disabled
libvidcap-0.2.1

Configured With:
./configure --prefix=$HOME/TalkFone --enable-local-gsm --enable-static --enable-clients=testcal
(clients iaxphone iaxcomm stresstest, etc require additional deps).


5) Kiax:
requires wxWidgets-3.0.x

Edit These Files To Use Libraries Built In The System:
kiax2core/gui.pro 
kiax2core/kiax2core.pro 

./qmake5
or
./qmake6
from kiax-code directory

kiax20-linux-static-libs.tar.gz
The libraries in this file are 32-Bit i386, and missing
libldns. But it shows the dependencies, and helps in
identifying versions used.

requires libldns
libldns ./configure --disable-dane-verify  --disable-dane-ta-usage

Add Kiax user to audio and video groups

